01:44.290 --> 01:49.130
Mob Psycho

01:54.000 --> 01:59.010
One Danger After Another
~Degeneration~

01:59.600 --> 02:00.970
Again...

02:01.220 --> 02:05.180
No matter how many times you ask,
I'm not going to curse anyone for you.

02:05.420 --> 02:07.070
Please leave.

02:07.350 --> 02:11.150
But you're a psychic, right?
Come on, don't be so spoilsport.

02:11.530 --> 02:14.260
I'm begging you. Curse this guy for me.

02:14.520 --> 02:15.730
I'm afraid I can't.

02:15.730 --> 02:19.100
You can't be serious!
I traveled really far to come see you!

02:19.100 --> 02:20.950
Nobody asked you to.

02:20.950 --> 02:23.170
What? Is that how you talk to a customer?!

02:23.170 --> 02:24.620
Are they going to fight?

02:24.780 --> 02:27.830
All right, all right! Fine, I'll do it.

02:27.830 --> 02:30.540
If there are
3 evil spirits,
the exorcism
fee on 1 of
them will be
on the house!!

02:28.130 --> 02:30.540
Really?! I knew it'd be worth the trip!

02:30.540 --> 02:31.460
The Spiritual Compendium  17th Edition

02:30.540 --> 02:31.710
~The Miraculous Unknown Psychic~

02:30.540 --> 02:32.760
But this is the only time I'm doing it.

02:32.760 --> 02:34.920
And I won't be held responsible
for what happens.

02:35.160 --> 02:35.750
Huh?

02:43.630 --> 02:46.190
Keep this on your person at all times.

02:45.060 --> 02:46.770
Curse

02:47.830 --> 02:48.800
The hell is this?

02:48.800 --> 02:50.730
It's a cursed, well, you know...

02:50.990 --> 02:54.380
As long as you have that with you,
I'm sure something will happen someday.

02:54.380 --> 02:55.470
Oh, I don't need any payment.

02:55.470 --> 02:58.440
But just make sure you don't
tell anyone else about this.

02:58.640 --> 03:00.470
I mean, I believe you,

03:01.100 --> 03:03.160
but if you're messing with me...

03:04.050 --> 03:06.490
I'm going to curse you.

03:09.140 --> 03:10.620
Man, he finally left.

03:11.080 --> 03:15.290
I mean, I can understand hating someone
so much you want to curse them...

03:15.290 --> 03:17.460
Do you have someone like that too, Master?

03:17.460 --> 03:18.780
Nope.

03:19.300 --> 03:20.620
Do you?

03:20.620 --> 03:22.370
Someone I want to curse?

03:25.090 --> 03:27.470
Uh, you don't need to think
so hard about it.

03:32.780 --> 03:33.380
Huh?

03:34.310 --> 03:35.180
Can't think of anyone.

03:35.180 --> 03:37.150
Don't take so long, then!
You actually scared me!

03:37.930 --> 03:41.030
Anyway, was it a good idea
to give him that thing?

03:41.220 --> 03:43.570
Well, I just cooked it up on the spot.

03:43.570 --> 03:45.370
I'm sure it won't harm anyone.

03:46.240 --> 03:48.060
Do you really think so?

03:48.610 --> 03:49.330
I mean...

03:50.080 --> 03:51.750
Even if it's a lie,

03:51.750 --> 03:53.750
First in the world!

03:51.750 --> 03:53.750
- Goku NERO -
0 Purine
0 Carbs
Alcohol 4%

03:51.750 --> 03:53.750
Pork Loin Tonkatsu Bento

03:52.040 --> 03:55.360
in his mind, he believes that he's
actually cursing someone.

03:56.590 --> 03:58.940
Is he going to keep living
under that impression?

03:59.820 --> 04:03.220
Isn't that rather frightening?

04:03.460 --> 04:04.680
Mob?

04:04.680 --> 04:09.390
The New Star of the 21st Century

04:04.680 --> 04:09.390
Reigen Arataka

04:04.870 --> 04:09.390
That's rare... He's actually
voicing his own opinion.

04:09.620 --> 04:13.480
Something's obviously bothering him.

04:13.480 --> 04:15.520
Did I miss something?

04:16.910 --> 04:19.070
Hello, this is Spirits and
Such Consultation Office.

04:20.600 --> 04:21.880
This is the place.

04:23.200 --> 04:25.810
At first, I thought it was a stalker,

04:25.810 --> 04:27.920
so I talked to the police.

04:29.000 --> 04:32.290
But it just didn't seem human...

04:32.760 --> 04:35.250
It was staring at me through
the window the other day!

04:35.480 --> 04:36.460
The window?

04:42.130 --> 04:44.340
Seasoning Moving Center

04:48.080 --> 04:51.310
We're on the fifth floor,
and there's no balcony... I see.

04:51.310 --> 04:52.220
You here, Dimple?

04:52.730 --> 04:53.690
The hell do you want?

04:53.690 --> 04:55.390
Could you check things out
around this window?

04:55.810 --> 04:58.610
See if there's a rope or something
dangling from the roof.

04:59.060 --> 05:00.650
And why do I have to do this?

05:00.650 --> 05:02.570
Feel free to eat any evil spirits you see.

05:02.820 --> 05:04.330
Mob, do you sense anything?

05:04.330 --> 05:06.280
Yes, though it's faint.

05:08.580 --> 05:10.700
Nope, not a damn thing.

05:11.110 --> 05:13.160
Why the hell did you close
the window, you jerk?!

05:13.500 --> 05:16.750
But there definitely
seems to be a stalker...

05:17.270 --> 05:21.180
What kind of interest would a ghost
have in a living woman?

05:21.180 --> 05:25.510
Beats me. It's pretty rare for spirits
to have any sexual desires left.

05:25.510 --> 05:27.760
It's not like they can reproduce anymore.

05:27.760 --> 05:30.850
But does love always have to
come with sexual desires?

05:30.850 --> 05:33.100
Actually, I don't want to
discuss this with you.

05:33.100 --> 05:34.980
Right back at you, ya jerk.

05:40.690 --> 05:42.860
Is this... a poltergeist?

05:43.080 --> 05:47.320
What do I do? It must be mad
I called you here.

05:49.270 --> 05:50.500
Did it settle down?

05:55.100 --> 05:56.000
Outside the window!

05:58.900 --> 06:00.420
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

06:00.760 --> 06:02.510
Mob! Vaporize it!

06:02.960 --> 06:03.880
That's...

06:04.440 --> 06:06.050
a living person.

06:06.270 --> 06:07.510
So it is a stalker!

06:08.310 --> 06:10.220
Damn it! He disappeared!

06:16.560 --> 06:17.860
He's in the next apartment.

06:25.230 --> 06:27.180
Who are these people? Why are they here?

06:27.180 --> 06:29.300
It's not like I did anything wrong.

06:29.300 --> 06:33.410
I mean, yeah, I'm sorry I used an
out of body experience to spy on you.

06:33.930 --> 06:36.580
But I seriously fell for you at first sight!

06:37.130 --> 06:41.070
I've never felt like this before...
I didn't know what to do.

06:42.040 --> 06:44.410
Y-Yeah... I'm serious about this.

06:44.410 --> 06:46.010
I'm going to go out with her!

06:46.900 --> 06:49.550
Don't get in my way! I'll murder you!

06:51.680 --> 06:53.300
Why, you—

06:53.300 --> 06:55.510
You pervy peeping tom!

06:55.510 --> 06:57.470
Ow, ow, owie!

06:58.150 --> 07:02.090
Say no to violence! Let me go!
I'll call the cops, you bastard!

07:02.090 --> 07:03.310
What are you talking about?

07:03.510 --> 07:06.850
I'm sorry! I was in the wrong!
I'll never do it again!

07:06.850 --> 07:08.070
Please forgive me!

07:08.290 --> 07:11.130
My feelings for you are genuine, though!

07:11.130 --> 07:12.760
So, please... p-p-p-p...

07:12.760 --> 07:13.960
You're seriously...

07:15.090 --> 07:18.620
You're seriously insanely creepy!

07:26.130 --> 07:28.080
I can't believe I was scared of that.

07:28.080 --> 07:31.740
So he tried to hide his stalking tendencies
behind a supernatural phenomenon.

07:31.740 --> 07:33.510
Don't try that at home, Shigeo.

07:34.020 --> 07:34.940
Why?

07:35.880 --> 07:39.780
Why does she feel so differently after finding
out it was a human and not an evil spirit?

07:39.780 --> 07:40.730
I don't understand...

07:40.940 --> 07:44.020
Man, he's got a lot on his mind today.

07:44.020 --> 07:46.090
Guess I'll pick his brain later.

07:46.090 --> 07:49.700
All right, let's head back
and grab some soba on the way.

07:50.690 --> 07:51.570
Okay...

07:55.800 --> 07:57.320
Oh, there he is!

07:57.320 --> 07:58.580
We were waiting for you!

07:58.750 --> 08:01.180
Hey, you sure got him working
a long part-time shift today.

08:01.180 --> 08:03.050
Three jobs in one day?

08:03.050 --> 08:04.790
That website is paying off.

08:06.030 --> 08:09.330
We want to make some memories
before we graduate, man!

08:09.330 --> 08:13.950
So, like, we want to go to some popular
haunted place and take a spirit photo.

08:13.950 --> 08:16.020
But it'd suck if we actually
ran into an evil spirit.

08:16.020 --> 08:17.300
So they're just messing around.

08:17.300 --> 08:19.380
But it's not like I'm
going to turn them down.

08:19.380 --> 08:20.520
When and where?

08:20.720 --> 08:23.440
Right now, my dude!
We've got a car waiting just outside!

08:23.810 --> 08:25.910
I doubt these guys have job offers lined up.

08:28.730 --> 08:32.070
What happened to getting there in
20 minutes? It's already been 30.

08:32.340 --> 08:34.860
I think it might take another 30.

08:34.860 --> 08:36.780
We might not have time for soba after all.

08:37.040 --> 08:39.850
So who the heck are you? His assistant?

08:39.850 --> 08:41.110
I'm a part-timer.

08:41.110 --> 08:43.760
You work part-time at a psychic's office?
That's hilarious.

08:43.760 --> 08:45.000
How much do you—

08:43.990 --> 08:45.000
Mob!

08:45.000 --> 08:47.920
Concentrate. Make sure you're
prepared for the unexpected.

08:47.920 --> 08:48.670
Right...

08:48.670 --> 08:51.000
Wow, you sound legit!

08:53.710 --> 08:54.870
We're here.

08:58.930 --> 09:00.920
Yo! This place is creepy AF!

09:00.920 --> 09:02.990
OMG! I'm so excited!

09:02.990 --> 09:03.980
Holy shit, man.

09:02.990 --> 09:03.980
Holy shit.

09:21.060 --> 09:22.340
You sense any spirits?

09:22.340 --> 09:23.640
Faintly...

09:23.640 --> 09:26.850
Doesn't deserve to be
a popular haunted spot, though.

09:26.850 --> 09:29.870
All right, hurry up and
take that picture, please.

09:29.870 --> 09:31.180
Got it!

09:33.230 --> 09:34.510
I'm taking it!

09:34.510 --> 09:37.890
Okay, say chee—
Actually, could you take it?

09:38.110 --> 09:41.580
I want to vehemently decline,
but they're customers, so what can I do?

09:41.580 --> 09:42.610
Okay, say chee—

09:42.610 --> 09:44.980
Oh, hey, don't forget the flash!

09:45.500 --> 09:47.060
Okay, say cheese.

09:51.480 --> 09:54.640
We should head back.
My disciple's still in middle school.

09:54.640 --> 09:55.850
Sure, thanks.

09:55.850 --> 09:57.410
TYVM.

09:56.090 --> 09:57.410
Thanks.

09:57.410 --> 09:59.910
Also, regarding the fee...

09:59.910 --> 10:01.530
What? Fee?

10:01.530 --> 10:03.240
What are you even talking about?

10:03.240 --> 10:05.910
What? The fee for this job.

10:05.910 --> 10:09.640
Nothing bad happened, and you
didn't even do anything, psychic dude!

10:09.640 --> 10:11.880
You really want us to pay you for nothing?

10:12.090 --> 10:13.610
Isn't that a scam?

10:13.610 --> 10:15.840
Yeah, like, a total scam!

10:18.500 --> 10:20.550
No pay, and then...

10:21.000 --> 10:22.830
Not even a ride back?

10:22.830 --> 10:25.020
Yup. I'd say the unexpected just happened.

10:25.350 --> 10:29.000
Oh, well. Let's head out to
the road and hail us a taxi.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.480
No soba tonight.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.070
Mob Psycho 100

10:42.070 --> 10:45.580
Mob Psycho 100

10:51.710 --> 10:52.720
Hey!

10:52.720 --> 10:54.240
Hey, kid!

10:54.240 --> 10:55.750
You ignoring me? Hey!

10:57.050 --> 11:00.660
Look at you, stumbling around.
You're in our way.

11:00.660 --> 11:02.510
But since you're here,
could you lend us some cash?

11:02.510 --> 11:04.430
Huh? But I don't have any.

11:04.430 --> 11:05.990
Why you freakin' out?

11:05.990 --> 11:07.850
Could you bring us some money tomorrow, then?

11:07.850 --> 11:08.500
Huh?

11:08.500 --> 11:09.810
You heard the guy.

11:14.220 --> 11:15.830
Uh, Sugimoto?

11:17.150 --> 11:18.910
Hey, what's wrong?

11:20.730 --> 11:22.770
Why are you stripping, Sugimoto?!

11:26.370 --> 11:28.200
I'm an angel!

11:30.360 --> 11:31.920
Sugimoto...

11:31.920 --> 11:34.460
Dimple, stop! Stop that!

11:35.980 --> 11:38.070
Sugimoto... Are you okay?

11:38.070 --> 11:39.810
I dunno...

11:39.810 --> 11:41.510
What just happened?

11:41.980 --> 11:43.340
Let's try this again!

11:44.430 --> 11:47.120
Hey, you little shit!
You were laughing just now, weren't you?

11:47.120 --> 11:48.440
I-I wasn't!

11:48.440 --> 11:50.730
Shut up! You get what this is, right?

11:50.730 --> 11:52.420
We're mugging yo—

11:55.570 --> 11:56.770
Sugimoto?!

12:00.060 --> 12:03.940
I'm okay! Let him go, Ritsu.

12:04.660 --> 12:05.410
You sure?

12:05.700 --> 12:07.790
They seem like a bad crowd.

12:08.860 --> 12:11.440
Dude, what's wrong with you, Sugimoto?

12:17.880 --> 12:20.320
Did you need something from our club member?

12:20.320 --> 12:21.090
Huh?

12:21.090 --> 12:23.030
Wh-Who the hell are you guys?!

12:23.390 --> 12:25.510
Who said you could surround
me like that, huh?

12:25.700 --> 12:27.600
Bring it on, you bastards!

12:27.600 --> 12:28.970
I'll kick yer asses!

12:29.130 --> 12:32.690
Hey, stop squishing me, damn it!

12:32.840 --> 12:35.420
Hey, I can't get out!

12:35.420 --> 12:38.090
Hey!

12:38.090 --> 12:41.110
Um, I'm fine, so please don't fight.

12:41.340 --> 12:42.780
Fair enough.

12:43.310 --> 12:44.780
Sugimoto!

12:44.970 --> 12:47.360
You'll regret this, you jerks!

12:47.930 --> 12:49.830
You sure you're all right?

12:49.830 --> 12:51.450
Yes. Thank you.

12:51.590 --> 12:54.220
You need to know when to
fight back, Kageyama.

12:54.220 --> 12:56.620
Or they're just going to try
to bully you even more.

12:56.620 --> 12:58.420
I can't think of a good way to.

12:58.820 --> 13:01.630
Kick their asses with your
shadow leader powers.

13:02.060 --> 13:06.200
You don't have to waste your powers
on guys like them, Nii-san.

13:06.200 --> 13:08.350
If they show up again, I'll get rid of them.

13:08.600 --> 13:13.810
Raking bad guys over the coals is
what's good for them and society.

13:14.040 --> 13:16.370
Make sure you kick their
asses on your own next time.

13:16.370 --> 13:18.270
You've got the power to do it.

13:20.730 --> 13:22.940
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

13:24.010 --> 13:26.160
What? You ended up with a spirit photo?

13:26.160 --> 13:29.830
Yes... So we wanted to
ask for your help again.

13:30.030 --> 13:33.750
Just throw some salt around.
I don't do volunteer work.

13:33.960 --> 13:36.620
We're really sorry! We'll pay!

13:38.930 --> 13:39.840
So what's the job?

13:40.000 --> 13:42.950
We want to go back to that haunted place

13:42.950 --> 13:46.260
and have you make the ghost
in this picture disappear!

13:48.890 --> 13:52.140
I mean, I can exorcise that
photograph if you'd like.

13:52.330 --> 13:54.060
We don't even need to go back to the place.

13:54.060 --> 13:58.380
No way! It's creepy enough
knowing that thing exists!

13:58.380 --> 13:59.270
Please get rid of it!

14:00.070 --> 14:02.630
So an exorcism request. Very well.

14:02.630 --> 14:04.230
Let me explain the various options.

14:04.230 --> 14:06.230
We'll take the most expensive one!

14:09.680 --> 14:11.410
Looks like you got dragged out again.

14:11.410 --> 14:13.390
And your Sunday got ruined yesterday.

14:13.390 --> 14:14.980
You can get pissed off about this, y'know?

14:25.130 --> 14:27.480
Please wrap this up as soon as possible.

14:47.310 --> 14:48.730
There're three of them.

14:48.730 --> 14:51.280
They don't seem to be evil spirits, though.

14:51.470 --> 14:54.810
We'll just have to take care of them.
They're scaring our clients.

14:54.810 --> 14:56.000
Go ahead and exorcise them.

14:57.310 --> 14:58.760
Please don't.

15:05.020 --> 15:07.710
The three of us are family.

15:08.170 --> 15:11.530
We died in an accident and
lost our chance at a good life.

15:12.360 --> 15:17.020
But now that we're ghosts,
we've been living here peacefully.

15:18.060 --> 15:19.970
We haven't done anything wrong.

15:20.340 --> 15:24.160
I just want... to stay with my
family a little bit longer.

15:25.660 --> 15:30.030
As soon as this desire is fulfilled,
we will disappear naturally.

15:30.530 --> 15:33.660
So I beg of you... Please, let us be.

15:34.180 --> 15:36.610
Did you hear that, Master?

15:36.610 --> 15:38.480
Nope, not a thing.

15:38.480 --> 15:39.960
Their aura must be too weak.

15:43.690 --> 15:46.360
Th-There's no reason to exorcise them.

15:46.360 --> 15:48.330
They said that they
wouldn't do anything bad.

15:48.330 --> 15:49.490
They're a family.

15:49.490 --> 15:50.340
Hello?!

15:50.610 --> 15:53.050
We called you here because we
need you to exorcise them!

15:53.050 --> 15:55.410
It's way too creepy knowing they're here!

15:55.410 --> 15:57.860
Who cares if they do anything bad or not?

15:57.860 --> 15:59.770
Not to mention, we said we'd pay you!

15:59.770 --> 16:01.690
Hurry up and exorcise them already!

16:01.690 --> 16:03.730
I'm getting goosebumps just standing here!

16:03.730 --> 16:05.690
It's so creepy,
I feel like I'm going to throw up.

16:05.870 --> 16:07.870
What's the matter, Mob?

16:07.870 --> 16:10.770
You've gotten rid of plenty
of evil spirits before.

16:11.230 --> 16:14.410
These people just want to live in peace.

16:14.820 --> 16:18.370
I can't... I don't want to destroy that.

16:18.960 --> 16:23.080
Just hurry up and do it already!
No one cares how you feel!

16:24.240 --> 16:29.150
Sir, we asked for your help
because we really needed it.

16:30.070 --> 16:33.010
Our customers always take top priority.

16:35.310 --> 16:39.430
However, if spirits deserve
as much respect as the living,

16:39.960 --> 16:43.810
and the three here are truly
just a family living peacefully...

16:44.400 --> 16:51.180
Then I can't make Mob do something as
heinous as barging in and dispatching them.

16:51.830 --> 16:54.950
But our clients' fear is real, too.

16:54.950 --> 16:56.120
What should I do?

16:56.120 --> 16:59.910
As a professional, can I really put
the ghosts above the clients?

17:00.230 --> 17:01.630
Hey, man of the house.

17:01.630 --> 17:05.750
I see you've got plenty of
pent-up spiritual power.

17:05.980 --> 17:06.880
Dimple?

17:07.260 --> 17:10.770
You gained that strength to
protect your family, right?

17:11.230 --> 17:12.510
In that case...

17:13.150 --> 17:15.970
Why not kill those three right now?

17:16.510 --> 17:20.820
They won't have to exorcise you
if the clients are dead.

17:24.630 --> 17:26.850
You want to live peacefully
with your family, right?

17:27.180 --> 17:30.320
Go on. What other choice do you have?

17:44.710 --> 17:45.840
Darling...

17:45.840 --> 17:47.670
Daddy...

17:48.020 --> 17:51.300
I beg of you... Please let us be.

17:52.060 --> 17:54.820
I cannot do something so horrific,

17:54.820 --> 17:56.260
especially in front of my child...

17:56.780 --> 17:59.220
I see. Well, what're you gonna do, then?

17:59.650 --> 18:02.780
But we have nowhere left to run.

18:02.780 --> 18:06.300
If you must go through with it,
we'll just have to accept it.

18:07.330 --> 18:08.580
But, please...

18:09.080 --> 18:12.420
Please, I ask that you
let us all go together,

18:12.870 --> 18:14.570
wherever it may be.

18:15.640 --> 18:18.700
Mob, are the spirits still saying something?

18:24.260 --> 18:25.150
You...

18:25.150 --> 18:27.240
Hey... So what's going on?

18:27.240 --> 18:28.800
A moment, please.

18:28.800 --> 18:29.930
What's wrong, Mob?

18:29.930 --> 18:32.590
He's so against exorcising them
that it's making him tremble.

18:32.810 --> 18:34.410
That much, huh?

18:34.410 --> 18:36.800
Okay, got it. Let's skip the exorcism.

18:37.420 --> 18:40.100
It's not like I'm ordering you.

18:40.100 --> 18:42.900
It's okay to listen to your feelings.

18:42.900 --> 18:46.160
Yup. You don't have to
take this so seriously.

18:46.160 --> 18:48.180
You're plenty strong, Shigeo.

18:48.980 --> 18:51.270
I don't think you understand...

18:56.560 --> 18:59.740
This must be something
that only I understand...

19:00.630 --> 19:04.240
I mean, there's no way I can
go off my feelings alone.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.530
I can't take this lightly.

19:06.060 --> 19:09.900
If I truly decide to protect this family,

19:10.670 --> 19:14.590
that'll mean the clients will
have to get hurt instead.

19:16.340 --> 19:18.160
How long is this gonna take, damn it?!

19:18.160 --> 19:19.630
Who cares what the brat—

19:22.440 --> 19:25.260
Yo, what the hell is this? Salt?!

19:25.690 --> 19:27.670
This concludes the exorcism.

19:27.670 --> 19:28.570
What?

19:28.570 --> 19:30.440
Wait, seriously?

19:30.440 --> 19:31.220
That was it?

19:31.730 --> 19:33.190
We're done here.

19:33.360 --> 19:35.140
Uh, okay.

19:36.900 --> 19:39.280
Reigen? What's the matter with you now?

19:39.700 --> 19:43.660
So that's what's going on here...
Why didn't I realize it sooner?

19:45.900 --> 19:48.800
He can do so much more
than an average person.

19:49.160 --> 19:51.490
The world he can see
is far bigger than ours.

19:52.130 --> 19:55.750
Curses and spirits are a
part of Mob's daily life.

19:56.880 --> 20:01.720
Both the human and the inhuman
are equally close to him.

20:02.220 --> 20:03.480
Damn it!

20:03.770 --> 20:07.880
It's all because I took too many jobs,
got complacent, and half-assed things.

20:11.420 --> 20:12.450
Let's head back.

20:14.780 --> 20:16.130
Want some soba?

20:17.200 --> 20:18.090
Okay.

20:31.410 --> 20:34.120
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

20:32.010 --> 20:34.120
You okay with that?

20:34.120 --> 20:38.590
The New Star of the 21st Century

20:34.120 --> 20:38.590
Reigen Arataka

20:34.120 --> 20:38.590
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

20:34.120 --> 20:38.590
You actually took money for just
throwing a bunch of salt around.

20:38.840 --> 20:40.290
What was I supposed to do?

20:40.290 --> 20:43.270
If I hadn't taken the money,
it would've been suspicious.

20:43.270 --> 20:46.300
More importantly, you're sure
they weren't evil spirits, right?

20:46.300 --> 20:47.720
If there are
3 evil spirits,
the exorcism fee
on 1 of them
will be on the
house!!

20:46.460 --> 20:50.620
Yeah. I tried to provoke him,
but he didn't turn into an evil spirit.

20:49.430 --> 20:51.270
If there are
3 evil spirits,
the exorcism fee
on 1 of them
will be on the
house!!

20:52.090 --> 20:53.440
Why are you trembling now?

20:54.960 --> 20:57.710
Oh, you're yawning.
Man, you two are like night and day.

20:58.310 --> 21:01.460
Hey, you've got something on your back.

21:01.460 --> 21:02.190
What?

21:02.700 --> 21:05.160
Yeah, someone definitely cursed you.

21:05.560 --> 21:07.390
What'll happen to me if I leave it alone?

21:07.390 --> 21:11.120
You might slip on a banana peel at least.

21:11.400 --> 21:13.960
That'd be enough to do me in
if I was on some stairs.

21:13.960 --> 21:14.930
Get rid of it for me.

21:14.930 --> 21:17.330
Your attitude sucks, so nope.

21:17.660 --> 21:20.090
Please, I can't ask Mob to do this for me.

21:20.690 --> 21:24.720
I bet the guy from yesterday hired
someone who could actually use curses.

21:24.720 --> 21:26.550
All right, fine.

21:26.550 --> 21:31.310
If there are
3 evil spirits,
the exorcism fee
on 1 of them
will be on the
house!!

21:26.550 --> 21:31.310
Reception

21:26.550 --> 21:31.310
The New Star of
the 21st Century
Reigen Arataka
Spirits and Such
Consultation Office

21:28.830 --> 21:31.310
He might be able to see
something more terrifying

21:31.960 --> 21:35.510
than anything that we can ever witness.

21:36.950 --> 21:38.630
The things he feared,

21:38.630 --> 21:40.190
and the things he avoided...

21:40.190 --> 21:46.110
Mob understood that they
were different from the norm.

21:43.150 --> 21:46.110
Shampoo

21:50.300 --> 21:53.800
If I ever end up wanting to curse someone...

21:54.410 --> 21:58.170
If I ever end up using my powers for evil...

21:58.910 --> 22:04.780
If I ever end up wanting to
eradicate people rather than spirits...

22:08.350 --> 22:11.860
I wonder if there will be anyone to stop me.

22:13.240 --> 22:18.370
Mob tried to think about everything
that happened over the past two days,

22:18.370 --> 22:21.720
but perhaps out of exhaustion,
he immediately fell asleep.

22:22.070 --> 22:25.070
Mob

23:55.940 --> 23:57.940
We've been invited to a rich guy's house!

23:57.940 --> 24:00.340
I smell a huge score!

24:00.340 --> 24:02.000
We're gonna make that money, Mob!

24:02.530 --> 24:04.750
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 4:

24:04.980 --> 24:06.580
"Inside ~Evil Spirit~."

24:06.960 --> 24:10.300
Inside
~Evil Spirit~

24:06.960 --> 24:10.300
A streaming service? But of course,
that's an excellent decision!
